","historical_business_count":8},{"category":"Breakfast & Brunch","historical_business_count":1}],"history":[{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"American (New), Breakfast & Brunch, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":4},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"American (New), Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"Nightlife","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"rZ2Uygsn6vmnUIAaN_DIzQ","review_id":"YH91qREqUf1ZP9KTEN4z4Q","date":"2016-08-18T20:54:33","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9476912617683411,"text_excerpt":"I first visited The Grill Room for my 21st birthday. I don't remember much about that experience, as I wasn't the food/restaurant lover that I am now. I was excited to return for a Coolinary lunch. Everything about The Grill Room is elegant: people dressing up for lunch, the white table cloths, the view, the wait staff- perfect. They opened their doors right at 11:30 and since we had a reservation we were seated immediately. Make a reservation because when we called, 11:30 was the only reservation left, which was fine by us. We were seated by a window that was facing the city on a cozy rainy afternoon. We started with cocktails as we decided what we wanted. Jason was our waiter and he was..."},{"business_id":"rZ2Uygsn6vmnUIAaN_DIzQ","review_id":"pn4zlea0J3gtsELVqve2VA","date":"2014-07-03T14:46:32","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9293093085289001,"text_excerpt":"We had a late check out from our room at the Windsor Court and had about two hours before we needed to leave for our flight. We decided to stay at the hotel and eat at The Grill Room. The dining room itself is beautiful. Large painted murals on each end of the restaurant, restaurant was clean and classy. Server was great (unlike our experience at Cochon), (AWILLIAMS) on receipt. She was very nice, didn't rush us, brought us everything we ordered in a timely manner. We ordered: Sazerac Cocktail and a glass of Pinot. Bottle is brought to your table so you can see what you are getting, a nice healthy pour to taste the wine. All good. For lunch (three of us) we ordered corn soup, the chicken ..."},{"business_id":"rZ2Uygsn6vmnUIAaN_DIzQ","review_id":"0Y2ZcfDZF6bjpKtDlHZXag","date":"2019-06-27T15:44:24","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9290347099304199,"text_excerpt":"Grill Room is located inside the beautiful Windsor Court. 3 hour valet parking is free. The 3 course lunch menu is a killer deal at $20. Plus, you can get $2 martinis made with Tito's Vodka or Plymouth Gin. The options to choose from are vast and the portions were perfect. 2 women were able to share 1 plate. The quality of the food was also very good. I really enjoyed everything but the gumbo. We both hated it. The Grill Room is just old world pretty. I feel like I am dining with the queen of England. (They do offer afternoon tea BTW.) We didn't make a reservation and lucked out with 1 table, they did say it was the only walk in spot of the day so I would def make a res. The service was a..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"rZ2Uygsn6vmnUIAaN_DIzQ","photo_id":"aLTyICWL8SlIch2V9EFgng","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/aLTyICWL8SlIch2V9EFgng.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8604583740234375},{"business_id":"rZ2Uygsn6vmnUIAaN_DIzQ","photo_id":"TNZYmjySyVlpTYttvPSyXQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/TNZYmjySyVlpTYttvPSyXQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8531259894371033},{"business_id":"rZ2Uygsn6vmnUIAaN_DIzQ","photo_id":"DRTmM-gbExV1Owa7CPx-Aw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/DRTmM-gbExV1Owa7CPx-Aw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.84538733959198},{"business_id":"rZ2Uygsn6vmnUIAaN_DIzQ","photo_id":"tBl350OCn1IB99vdwDG9og","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/tBl350OCn1IB99vdwDG9og.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.816704511642456},{"business_id":"rZ2Uygsn6vmnUIAaN_DIzQ","photo_id":"utEruKih_A0iOO7ZEqJnbg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/utEruKih_A0iOO7ZEqJnbg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7399308085441589}]},"notebook_case":null}
